  "content": "\n\n<h1>ArnicaLib</h1>\n<p>AH 的 Minecraft 模組共享函式庫。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/auioc/arnicalib-mcmod?style=flat-square\" alt=\"GitHub 授權條款\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/auioc/arnicalib-mcmod/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/auioc/arnicalib-mcmod?style=flat-square\" alt=\"GitHub 發行版本\"></a></p>\n<h2>維護者</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/WakelessSloth56\" rel=\"nofollow\">@WakelessSloth56</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lainio24\" rel=\"nofollow\">@LainIO24</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.auioc.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">AUIOC</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforums.minecraftforge.net%252fprofile%252f187809-camhex%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">CamHex</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/HaruhiFanClub\" rel=\"nofollow\">HaruhiFanClub</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Libellule505\" rel=\"nofollow\">Libellule505</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/bgxd9592\" rel=\"nofollow\">bgxd9592</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>參與貢獻</h2>\n<p>歡迎任何形式的貢獻，以下提供一些您可以為此專案做出貢獻的範例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>提交 <a href=\"https://github.com/auioc/arnicalib-mcmod/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題報告</a> 以回報錯誤或提出疑問。</li>\n<li>發起 <a href=\"https://github.com/auioc/arnicalib-mcmod/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">合併請求</a> 來改善我們的程式碼。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p>ArnicaLib 採用 <strong>GNU 通用公眾授權條款 v3.0</strong> 授權。\n完整的授權條款請見 <a href=\"https://github.com/auioc/arnicalib-mcmod/blob/1.18-forge/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a> 檔案。</p>",
